    },
    {
        "text": "*huff*... *huff*... That's all the ink spirits over here handled...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marcille"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_139#2",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Much appreciated.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dawn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$path_intro",
        "key": "$path_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4141_marcil_1#17$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, don't mention it! We're happy to help with any of your troubles, considering the village agreed to take us in for a bit.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marcille"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4143_sensi_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll be off then. Promised to help plant some veggies out in the fields.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Senshi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4144_chilc_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Senshi sure has gotten friendly with the locals.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chilchuck"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_139#2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is it not the same for you, Chilchuck? Uncle Zhang told me to invite you over for a drink with him after you finished with the ink spirits.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dawn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4144_chilc_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "He just doesn't want to admit he can't outdrink me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chilchuck"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4141_marcil_1#17$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "May I come over for some tea today, Dawn?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marcille"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_139#2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Certainly, I am available if you are.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dawn"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's your turn to tell tales of your adventures, and I am quite looking forward to them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dawn"
    },
    {
        "text": "Though... I do recall that when you first arrived, you mentioned that you had to save Laios's sister.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dawn"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you <i>sure</i> you are alright with staying here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dawn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4141_marcil_1#17$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's true that our goal is to save Falin.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marcille"
    },
    {
        "text": "But...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marcille"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4141_marcil_1#18$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's not like rushing will help us find a way to leave faster.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marcille"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4141_marcil_1#17$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "And I have to admit, life is good here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marcille"
    },
    {
        "text": "We'll talk it over when the time comes. Right, Laios?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marcille"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4142_laios_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm? Sorry, what did you say?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4141_marcil_1#13$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't believe you weren't listening to me again!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marcille"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_139#2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "*chuckle* Your passion for ink spirits is well-known across the village by now, Laios.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dawn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4142_laios_1#16$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I mean, these 'ink spirit' slimes are just so interesting!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4142_laios_1#18$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "They have fixed forms with distinct heads, bodies, and limbs! Instead of enveloping their prey's heads, they attack like other beasts! They even vocalize!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "text": "But the strangest part is how, unlike other monsters, they don't leave behind any kind of corpse, just some black water.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4141_marcil_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marcille"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4142_laios_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I told the villagers all about their weaknesses yesterday, but they didn't seem very excited.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4141_marcil_1#22$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's because you're the only person who cares about that sort of stuff.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marcille"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4142_laios_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Huh, is that so?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4142_laios_1#13$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But even Chilchuck's learned to exploit those weaknesses. The villagers can't seem to grasp them at all. Every time I see them facing ink spirits, it's like they have no idea what they're doing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_143#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gkh-gkh!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ink Spirit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 255,
        "g": 255,
        "b": 255,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
