        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 255,
        "g": 255,
        "b": 255,
        "fadetime": 0.03,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$e_skill_skulsrsword",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 255,
        "g": 255,
        "b": 255,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4142_laios_1#13$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm starting to suspect they can even understand us...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's odd. Senshi said they're not like slimes at all. Slimes have distinct organs, after all...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4141_marcil_1#22$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, alright, I get it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marcille"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1427_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4141_marcil_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm? Did some of them slip through?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marcille"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1427_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hraaagh\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ink Spirit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$runsand",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4142_laios_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm? That one looked a bit familiar... It's got a mole on its face. Where have I seen that before?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4142_laios_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm pretty sure I killed the exact same one a few days ago. Why's it shown up again?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4142_laios_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's going on here? ...Wait, could it have come back from the dead? I'm going to go get a better look!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4141_marcil_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Remember to be back for dinner!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marcille"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4141_marcil_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...*sigh* And he's not listening. As usual.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marcille"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry he's like that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marcille"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_139#2",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, it's fine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dawn"
    },
    {
        "text": "Anyway, do you still remember how long it's been since you arrived at P'o-shan Village?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dawn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4141_marcil_1#14$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course I...",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Marcille"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4141_marcil_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm?",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Marcille",
        "end": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4141_marcil_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "How long <i>has</i> it been since we arrived?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Marcille"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
