    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4142_laios_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait, wait wait wait... There's way WAY too many of you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_143#1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_143#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gkh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ink Spirits"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4142_laios_1#14$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "We might not have been here long, but we've been killing plenty of ink spirits every day. Who would've thought there'd still be this many left?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4142_laios_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "There are so many of them here, yet there's no sign of fighting... Could they actually coexist peacefully?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_143#1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_143#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ink Spirits"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4142_laios_1#13$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't see any of their young, though.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now that I think about it, I can't tell their genders, either. They're all adults too, no young or old. No matter how you look at it, it's no ordinary monster cluster.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4142_laios_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm? Wait, where'd the familiar-looking one go?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_143#1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "action": "jump",
        "power": 30,
        "times": 1,
        "duration": 0.5,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4142_laios_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Crap, that one spotted me!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4142_laios_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've got to think of a way to stop it from calling over more! I can't take them all on my own\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_143#1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "action": "jump",
        "power": 30,
        "times": 1,
        "duration": 0.5,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "action": "jump",
        "power": 30,
        "times": 1,
        "duration": 0.5,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "action": "jump",
        "power": 30,
        "times": 1,
        "duration": 0.5,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4142_laios_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh no, it's about to call out\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_143#1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ink Spirit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4142_laios_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Here, have some fruit!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_143#1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 20,
        "ystrength": 20,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Gkh...haaa? Munch munch...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ink Spirit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Munch munch...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ink Spirit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gkh.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ink Spirit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4142_laios_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's that, you want more?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_143#1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gkh, gkh.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ink Spirit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4142_laios_1#18$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "As long as you don't start shouting.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "text": "Here, I was saving them as a snack, but... Look, just eat quietly, and come over when you're done. Then we can go around the back of this wall and...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
