        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4142_laios_1#10$1",
        "posfrom": "-100,0",
        "posto": "0,0",
        "duration": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "afrom": 0,
        "ato": 1,
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4142_laios_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're awfully well-behaved. What's going on here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_143#1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Sneakily climbs behind the wall)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ink Spirit"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Ready to pounce at apricots on the ground)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ink Spirit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "action": "jump",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "50,0",
        "power": 80,
        "times": 1,
        "duration": 0.5,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "(Apricots pounced! Proceeds to gobble up apricots)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ink Spirit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4142_laios_1#16$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "It just attacked the village, but now it's docile over a few pieces of fruit?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_143#1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Nom nom nom)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ink Spirit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "50,0",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "posfrom": "50,0",
        "posto": "0,0",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "(Bites onto Laios's pocket)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ink Spirit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4142_laios_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm? What're you up to now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "text": "You attack the village, yet you don\u2019t seem any happier when you win, and you flee when you lose. Now you're just snacking on apricots!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4142_laios_1#16$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You do fight over food, but it makes no sense to attack the village for it\u2014there are way more fruits in the mountains. So why attack so often just for a few fruits?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "text": "The villagers haven\u2019t stolen your young or encroached on your territories, so where's all this hostility coming from?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1427_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4142_laios_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait, isn't that the one with the mole from earlier?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4142_laios_1#3$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Take this!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_clothmovement",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1427_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 20,
        "ystrength": 20,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Laios sends an apricot flying at the familiar-looking ink spirit, striking it right in the head with a 'pok!'"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "action": "jump",
        "power": 50,
        "times": 1,
        "duration": 0.5,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "action": "jump",
        "power": 50,
        "times": 1,
        "duration": 0.5,
        "isblock": true
    },
    {
        "text": "It staggers from the blow, but quickly recovers and raises its stubby arms to cover its head."
    },
    {
        "text": "But that's when the sweet scent of apricot hits it."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1427_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hruuh!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ink Spirit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4142_laios_1#18$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait, are you here to eat apricots too?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "text": "Here, catch.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1427_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hruuh! Hruuh!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ink Spirit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Munch munch...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ink Spirit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4142_laios_1#18$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let me have a closer look... Same mole, slightly bigger head than the rest, a slender yet forked tail...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Laios"
    },
    {
